---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Eliana Betancur" description="About Eliana Betancur — design systems work, background, and how to get in touch.">
  <div class="min-h-[calc(100vh-80px)] flex items-center px-6 sm:px-10 py-20">
    <div class="w-full page-reveal">
      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.1] mb-6">
        Four years in, and token naming is still the hardest part of the job.
      </h1>

      <p class="font-sans text-lg sm:text-xl text-warmgray-700 leading-relaxed mb-10">
        I spent four years helping scale a small internal design system at UnitedHealthcare into one adopted org-wide — working closely with engineering and accessibility teams to get it there.
      </p>

      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-10">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-base text-warmgray-700">
          <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-2 bg-rust-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Led a WCAG 2.1 AA compliance initiative across the full component library
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-base text-warmgray-700">
          <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-2 bg-rust-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Currently finishing a Computer Science degree with a UX minor at DePaul, using coursework and side projects to stay hands-on with new front-end tech
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 font-sans text-base text-warmgray-700">
          <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 mt-2 bg-rust-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Looking for a team that takes the design-to-engineering handoff seriously
        </li>
      </ul>

      <nav aria-label="Professional links" class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 font-mono text-sm">
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/eliana-betancur" class="text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-rust-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/gneliana" class="text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-rust-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.figma.com/design/U49gXIbwVYqFNFQnUIWLqv/Eliana-Betancur---DS?node-id=91-4755" class="text-rust-700 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-rust-600 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-rust-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2">Figma</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-reveal {
    animation: rise 0.6s ease-out both;
  }
  @keyframes rise {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .page-reveal { animation: none; }
  }
</style>